      "requires": { "level": 7, "quest": 94946 },
      "note": "Quest 94946 calls it the skycutter ship; object 716301 'Portal To Dalaran' stands at the same dock. The path and its stops are in the client and the quest is the High Order's, so the route and the faction stand. Not confirmed: that it is the ship and not the portal ('kind'), the exact arrival point ('arrival'), and boarding without the quest or riding back, although the path loops to the isle ('boarding'). So it is planned as a ship, one way and only with the quest." },
